# Phase 5 (plan 05-12, D-26): the six requirements INP-01 INP-02 INP-03 API-03 AUD-01 AUD-02. Each line is a
# mechanism that is the sole evidence against a silent pass of its requirement. The audit behind this list is
# in .planning/phases/05-hand-controllers-and-psg-sound/05-VERIFICATION.md.

# INP-01: each of the 31 controls reads its documented byte on each port. A changed generator, a swapped
# port, a missing inversion or a changed literal row must fail the single-control matrix.
