input-literal control input-source-unknown INP-01
input-literal control input-byte-mismatch INP-01
input-literal control input-profile-mask-mismatch INP-01
input-literal mutant input.judge.table-row-changed INP-01

# INP-02: combinations follow the union rule, the wiki anchors and the decodability properties.
